Package: cameradata
Title: Clean and Summarize Camera Trap Monitoring Data
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Ciencia de Datos",
           family = "GECI",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "ciencia.datos@islas.org.mx"
           ))
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Description: Cleans and summarizes camera trap monitoring data. Joins the
    camera field checks with the camera memory checks, fills the missing weekly 
    records, and produces a daily summary of the installed camera traps, 
    sampling effort, captured photos, and detected individuals.
